      "text": "And we should warn the accounting firms that parse our PDFs."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-partial-invoice-redesign:seg:7",
      "text": "I'll email the three firms on the integration list this week."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-partial-invoice-redesign:seg:8",
      "text": "Thanks. Do we keep the old layout available as an option?"
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-partial-invoice-redesign:seg:9",
      "text": "No. One layout."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-partial-invoice-redesign:seg:10",
      "text": "Agreed."
    }
